  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Minor third interval famous from:\n\n- A) Greensleeves opening\n- B) Star Wars fanfare\n- C) Here Comes the Bride\n- D) Happy Birthday first two notes\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Perfect fifth sounds stable and open.\n\n**Answer:** True\n\n### Q3. Tritone spans:\n\n- A) 6 semitones\n- B) 7 semitones\n- C) 5 semitones\n- D) 12 semitones\n\n**Answer:** A",
